  "job_A10.3_20260920_210245": {
    "text": "Her Eadgar w\u00e6s, Engla waldend, cor\u00f0re miclum to cyninge gehalgod on \u00f0\u00e6re ealdan byrig,\n\u00de\u00e6r w\u00e6s blis micel on \u00feam eadgan d\u00e6ge eallum geworden, \u00feone ni\u00f0a bearn nemna\u00f0 and ciga\u00f0\n\u00de\u00e6r w\u00e6s preosta heap, micel muneca \u00f0reat, mine gefrege, gleawra gegaderod.\nAnd \u00f0a agangen w\u00e6s tyn hund wintra geteled rimes fram gebyrdtide bremes cyninges, leohta hyrdes,\nAnd him Eadmundes eafora h\u00e6fde nigon and XX, ni\u00f0weorca heard, wintra on worulde, \u00f0a \u00feis",
